OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters honour 9/11
OL,4,Acolleagues in climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters from Kent flew to the US
OL,7,Fto climb 110 floors in full kit while
OL,8,Fcarrying the names and photos of
OL,9,Fcolleagues killed in the 9/11 attacks.
OL,11,FCrews from Maidstone, Chatham, Dartford
OL,12,Fand Westerham joined 343 UK
OL,13,Ffirefighters at the memorial challenge
OL,14,Fin Atlanta.
OL,16,FEach represented one of the 343 New
OL,17,FYork firefighters who died in the
OL,18,Fattacks as they completed the climb in
OL,19,F37C heat and 78% humidity.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
