OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters honour 9/11
OL,4,Acolleagues in climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Luckhurst, of Kent Fire and
OL,7,FRescue Service, said: "An added
OL,8,Fdifficulty was the emotion that you
OL,9,Fwere feeling, we were all carrying
OL,10,Fphotographs of a firefighter that died
OL,11,Fin 9/11 and it was very poignant."
